[32m+[m[32m4. Token exchange and secure local session persistence[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Authenticated bootstrap through `GET /api/Agent/me`[m
[32m+[m[32m6. Placeholder authenticated home[m
[32m+[m[32m7. Local sign-out[m
