[32m+[m[32m## Source Of Truth[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Platform: Android only[m
[32m+[m[32m- Halo sandbox: `https://newformaholdingsdev.haloitsm.com/`[m
[32m+[m[32m- Verified tenant discovery facts from Thursday, July 16, 2026 live in `docs/halo-tenant-discovery.md`[m
